// The admitted crossing keeps its owner-authorized membership: a direct call to
// the boundary requirement itself may assume `result in Granted & Vacant`.
// Its sibling fail fixture (content_membership_return_adapter_weaker_guarantee)
// shows that a direct call to a checked realization of the same requirement
// may not, because the realization guarantees only what its own contract
// declares.
use omega::language::core::extent;
machine direct(storage: Extent in Granted) -> Extent
ensures result in Granted & Vacant
{ VacantContentTransfer::transfer(storage) }
machine main() {}
